0260807-deepseek-raise-prices/"}, {"title": "c 215329073", "url": "https://substack.com/@michaeljburry/note/c-215329073"}, {"title": "data science machine learning", "url": "https://www.bitdeer.ai/en/blog/tag/data-science-machine-learning/"}, {"title": "deepseek v4", "url": "https://www.cometapi.com/tag/deepseek v4/"}, {"title": "new version of deepseek to potentially be unveiled over the weekend via x", "url": "https://www.newsquawk.com/headlines/new-version-of-deepseek-to-potentially-be-unveiled-over-the-weekend-via-x"}, {"title": "DeepSeek V4 Release Date: When It Launched and What Comes Next", "url": "https://framia.converge.ai/page/en-US/news/deepseek-v4-release-date"}]}, "搜索结果中没有找到2026年10月17日DeepSeek公告或deepseek-flash升级的相关内容。\n\n与查询最接近的信息有:\n\n- **V4系列发布:** DeepSeek于2026年4月发布了V4系列预览版,包括约1.6万亿参数的V4-Pro和约2840亿参数的V4-Flash。两者都支持百万token上下文,并采用MIT许可证。(来源:neuronfeed.com)\n- **Flash版本:** 有报道称,2026年7月31日,DeepSeek发布了模型\"DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731\",并以可商用许可证的开放模型形式提供。\n- **API调整:** 同一报道提到,DeepSeek宣布大幅提高API价格,原因可能是低价策略引发需求激增。\n- **旧接口下线:** 发布时间表显示,2026年7月24日,旧的deepseek-chat和deepseek-reasoner接口退役。(来源:framia.converge.ai,为第三方整理,未必可靠)\n\n这些来源多为二手报道或第三方网站,我没有找到DeepSeek官方10月公告原文。建议直接查看DeepSeek官网的更新日志或API文档,确认10月17日是否有相关公告。"], "durationSeconds": 5.647215458000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01Wh1isbrBqbv1LXRiMKWG5p", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01KiAMak3nMwMHuxsysRJ14x", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://pureai.com/articles/2026/08/07/deepseek-releases-v4-flash-update-with-stronger-agent-scores-and-unchanged-pricing.aspx\"}, {\"url\": \"https://technode.com/2026/07/31/deepseek-puts-v4-flash-api-into-public-beta\"}, {\"url\": \"https://we0.ai/de/articles/deepseek-flash-api-update-claims-what-is-2cceab91\"}, {\"url\": \"https://we0.ai/pt/articles/deepseek-flash-api-update-claims-what-is-2cceab91\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.morphllm.com/deepseek-api\"}, {\"url\": \"https://seawork.ai/en/blogs/deepseek-v4-flash-0731/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.modemguides.com/blogs/ai-news/deepseek-v4-flash-official-release\"}, {\"url\": \"https://agentpedia.codes/blog/deepseek-v4-flash-0731-codex-responses-api-guide.md\"}, {\"url\": \"https://agentpedia.codes/blog/deepseek-v4-flash-0731-codex-responses-api-guide\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:16:37.055Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "DeepSeek API changelog October 17 2026 deepseek-flash upgraded to", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_015vQC4R3ynEHdQR4r74AfLA", "content": [{"title": "deepseek releases v4 flash update with stronger agent scores and unchanged pricing", "url": "https://pureai.com/articles/2026/08/07/deepseek-releases-v4-flash-update-with-stronger-agent-scores-and-unchanged-pricing.aspx"}, {"title": "deepseek puts v4 flash api into public beta", "url": "https://technode.com/2026/07/31/deepseek-puts-v4-flash-api-into-public-beta"}, {"title": "deepseek flash api update claims what is 2cceab91", "url": "https://we0.ai/de/articles/deepseek-flash-api-update-claims-what-is-2cceab91"}, {"title": "deepseek flash api update claims what is 2cceab91", "url": "https://we0.ai/pt/articles/deepseek-flash-api-update-claims-what-is-2cceab91"}, {"title": "DeepSeek API: Models, Pricing, and How to Call It (2026)", "url": "https://www.morphllm.com/deepseek-api"}, {"title": "DeepSeek V4 Flash Official API (0731): 82.7 Terminal-Bench, $0.14/$0.28 & Agent Upgrades", "url": "https://seawork.ai/en/blogs/deepseek-v4-flash-0731/"}, {"title": "DeepSeek V4-Flash 0731: The Upgrade Everyone Can Use and Nobody Can Download", "url": "https://www.modemguides.com/blogs/ai-news/deepseek-v4-flash-official-release"}, {"title": "# DeepSeek V4 Flash 0731: Codex and Responses API Guide", "url": "https://agentpedia.codes/blog/deepseek-v4-flash-0731-codex-responses-api-guide.md"}, {"title": "deepseek v4 flash 0731 codex responses api guide", "url": "https://agentpedia.codes/blog/deepseek-v4-flash-0731-codex-responses-api-guide"}]}, "I couldn't find any changelog entry dated October 17, 2026 for a \"deepseek-flash\" upgrade. The closest match is a July 31, 2026 update.\n\n- **No October 17 entry found:** A German-language article says the official changelog it checked on October 15 had no such announcement, and that user observations reported by QbitAI around that date don't confirm a release. The same article says the current official mapping for deepseek-flash is DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash, and that deepseek-v4-flash aliases now route to V4.1-Flash and are billed at Flash prices. Its Portuguese counterpart says the same.\n- **July 31 update:** Several sources describe DeepSeek putting the V4-Flash API into public beta as build 0731. One says the update is a post-training upgrade to the same model size, with stronger agent scores. Another says the model name is unchanged and the V4-Pro API and the app and web chat were not changed. Open weights on Hugging Face were still the April preview.\n- **Caveats:** Most of these are third-party write-ups, and some appear to be AI-generated, so I'd verify against DeepSeek's own API docs at api-docs.deepseek.com before relying on them. I didn't find the official changelog text itself."], "durationSeconds": 6.491775292000001,