{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01BHwrxe7y794CRD4WqGTgV6", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/news/news261017/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/news/news260910/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/updates/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/news/news260424/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/news/news260821/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/api/list-models/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/coding_agents/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/anthropic_api/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:16:48.969Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "api-docs.deepseek.com news deepseek-flash DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01GszMZGgu3CjWAsgg66GBfA", "content": [{"title": "DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017: Wish-Driven Programming Made Real", "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/news/news261017/"}, {"title": "DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash: Smarter, Faster, More Efficient", "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/news/news260910/"}, {"title": "Change Log", "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/updates/"}, {"title": "DeepSeek V4 Preview Release", "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/news/news260424/"}, {"title": "Your First API Call", "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/"}, {"title": "Models & Pricing", "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing/"}, {"title": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp Release: Multimodal API Now Live", "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/news/news260821/"}, {"title": "Lists Models", "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/api/list-models/"}, {"title": "Integrate with AI Tools", "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/coding_agents/"}, {"title": "Using the Anthropic API", "url": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/anthropic_api/"}]}, "The DeepSeek docs show that the `deepseek-flash` API name now serves DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017, which was released on October 17, 2026.\n\n- **Latest version:** The changelog says DeepSeek V4.1 Flash has been upgraded to DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017, and the API calling method and pricing remain unchanged. The model page also says the model is served by DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017, and the calling method remains unchanged.\n- **Benchmarks:** The changelog reports that the new version beats the previous V4.1 on several benchmarks, with DeepSWE v1.1 at 77.0. The release post says it is stronger on benchmarks, faster at completing tasks, and produces shorter outputs.\n- **Original V4.1-Flash:** The first V4.1-Flash release was on September 10, 2026. It is the smallest model in the new architecture family and includes visual understanding. Set your model to deepseek-flash.\n- **Retired names:** V4-Flash & V4-Flash-Vision-Exp are retired. For compatibility, deepseek-v4-flash and deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp temporarily route to V4.1-Flash.\n- **Specs:** The models page lists a context length of 1M and a maximum output of 384K. The `/models` endpoint lists `deepseek-flash` with image and text input and effort levels low, high, and max.\n- **Search & Fetch:** These server-side tools are free for now. Billing starts Oct 31, 2026, at 16:00 UTC."], "durationSeconds": 6.851914292000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01BHwrxe7y794CRD4WqGTgV6", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
